# ASUS ROG Ryuo IV screen, Android recovery, after Info Hub was handed the
# official 1.0.3 firmware package while the device was running 1.0.10.
#
# Transcribed from a photo of the panel -- the device has no buttons, so the
# menu's "Use volume up/down and power" instruction is unusable and the only
# way out is `adb reboot`.
#
# Nothing was flashed. Note "result 0" on the verification line: the package
# SIGNATURE was accepted. The downgrade was stopped purely by the timestamp
# assertion afterwards.

